id: micro-band
name: Micro Band
kind: gear
itemType: accessory
tags: tech
craftDC: Master
# "At the cost of 1 Action, you may reduce your Size Category to the Tiny or Nano Size
# Category. You can spend 1 Action to return to your base Size Category."
shrinksTo: tiny, nano
shrinkCost: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  An Action to shrink to Tiny or Nano, and an Action to come back.
text: >
  Micro Band [Tech]: A watch that allows you to shrink.
  –Craft DC: Master
  –Effects: At the cost of 1 Action, you may reduce your Size Category to the Tiny or Nano
  Size Category. You can spend 1 Action to return to your base Size Category.

---

# While worn, its row has Shrink: an Action, and Tiny or Nano - whichever is smaller than the
# Size they were built as. Return is an Action back to that Size.
#
# The Size named stands in for the one they were built as, so everything a Size changes
# follows it - Melee Range, Speed, Defense Value, Soak Value, the Skills a Size moves. Anything
# that moves them by steps, Liquid's "reduce your Size Category by 1", moves them from it.
#
# Taken off while shrunk, they are back at their own Size: an Accessory "apply benefits while
# equipped".
